  ],
  "description": "Original guitar 900 Hz setting on Aion FX Quartz reference circuit. The VTL5C3 photocell responds to sensed LED current with attack and release. The emitter followers use unity-gain buffer equivalents. IC1 uses the OP275 card. IC2 uses the legacy LM358 class-B output stage and calibrated integrator limits on the 8.65 V internal supply. Indicator-only circuitry and the adaptation’s frequency toggle are omitted.",
